{"id":"b94dbd8a81210c41","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-boolean-function.md","title":"Boolean Function","display":"df-boolean-function — Boolean Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boolean-function","aliases":["58-df-boolean-function","58-df-boolfn"],"display":"df-boolean-function — Boolean Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boolean-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boolean-function</span><span>58-df-boolfn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-function — Boolean Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFn}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFn}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (finite-arity Boolean-function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolFn}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,2^n,2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolFn}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,2^n,2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span> is the set of Boolean vectors of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Boolean-formula syntax, evaluation, encodings, truth tables, and bounded truth-table classes require separate atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFn}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoolFn}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,2^n,2)","display":true},{"tex":"2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-function]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-boolean-function.md|58-df-boolean-function]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}